      <p>Explore Zanzibar's UNESCO World Heritage Stone Town with a licensed local guide. This historic district features:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Carved wooden doors from the 19th century</li>
        <li>Sultan's Palace Museum and House of Wonders</li>
        <li>Forodhani Gardens night market</li>
        <li>Old Fort and Darajani Market</li>
        <li>Arabic and European colonial architecture</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Tours typically last 2–4 hours and cover the heart of Zanzibar's Swahili, Arab, and European heritage.</p>
